# P17 multi-hop eviction-hygiene verification script.
# befallen (initial) -> qeynos2 -> befallen -> qeynos2 -> gfaydark, all in
# one process, texture ledger on (--texture-ledger), to exercise the P17
# unload-release fix across 4 zone TRANSITIONS (5 zone visits total).
# Each wait is generous to cover network handshake + full sequential load
# + a settle period for progressive/deferred asset loading before the next
# hop is issued.

wait 45
/say #zone qeynos2
wait 45
/say #zone befallen
wait 45
/say #zone qeynos2
wait 45
/say #zone gfaydark
wait 45
/camp
wait 5
